<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86433" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προᾰγωγ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leading on, promotion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Posidon.
				36J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				6.18
			</span></i>; <i>rank, eminence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.8.4
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				15.34.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ χιλιάρχων τάξις καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.48
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαγωγῆς τυχεῖν ἐν τῇ αὐλῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					4.13.14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.466c
			</span></i>(pl.), <i>Cat. Cod.Astr.</i><i><span class="en">
				2.198
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν π. τινὰ ποιεῖσθαι</span>
			<i>promote</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				15.1.1
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ θεωρητικὸς βίος π. ἀγῶνος
					τελειοτέρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.551
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>progress, prosperity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				223.9
			</span></i> (Erythrae, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>preference,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Stoic.
				3.35
			</span></i>.</div>
